=== the c-trajectory seam, assembled ===
  the structure hands over V^T f (3 x 14) and the body turns it into
  a velocity (3 x 3); composed, the seam is 3 x 14.
  singular values: 1.158606e-08, 4.600938e-10, 4.084444e-11
  beta = 4.084444e-11   kappa = 283.6632

  **This bond is two-sided and the b-c MECH one is not.** The body
  responds to a load with a velocity natively -- no time derivative
  is supplied and none is declared -- while the shell's flow had to be
  du/dt at a stated clock. The contrast is the tier's point.

